{
  "uid": "kestrel-payments-api",
  "title": "payments-api \u2014 is it healthy?",
  "description": "Indicators chosen and written down before any threshold existed.",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": false,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "tags": [
    "kestrel-pay"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "namespace",
        "label": "environment",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "dev,staging",
        "current": {
          "text": "dev",
          "value": "dev"
        },
        "options": [
          {
            "text": "dev",
            "value": "dev",
            "selected": true
          },
          {
            "text": "staging",
            "value": "staging",
            "selected": false
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Is it there?",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read this",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "The rate panels **exclude the kubelet's health probes**. They did not at first, and that was wrong in a way worth knowing: probe traffic kept every number moving, so a service nobody was calling looked busy, and a failing readiness probe looked like users getting errors.\n\nWith probes excluded, **zero traffic and a healthy service look identical** below. That is why the row above comes first \u2014 it answers whether the service is *there*, a different question from whether it is *succeeding*.\n\n| what you see | what it means |\n|---|---|\n| up, no traffic | idle \u2014 normal here |\n| **targets above available** | a pod is running but not ready |\n| **updated below desired** | a deploy is wedged; the old version still serves |\n| available at zero | genuinely down |\n\nColour marks *category*, never severity. No panel declares a number too high \u2014 that is a release decision and it does not live here."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Targets up",
      "description": "Scrape targets answering. Can exceed available replicas: a not-ready pod is still scraped.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 5,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "blue"
          },
          "unit": null,
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(up{job=\"payments-api\", namespace=\"$namespace\"}) or vector(0)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Replicas available",
      "description": "The cluster's own view, so this still answers when the pod cannot be scraped.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 5,
        "x": 13,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "green"
          },
          "unit": null,
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(kube_deployment_status_replicas_available{deployment=\"payments-api\", namespace=\"$namespace\"}) or vector(0)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Versions serving",
      "description": "More than one means two versions are serving at once.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "purple"
          },
          "unit": null,
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "none",
                  "index": 0
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "graphMode": "none"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "count(count by (version) (payments_api_build_info{namespace=\"$namespace\"})) or vector(0)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Container restarts",
      "description": "Climbs when liveness fails. This is what separates a crash loop from a stalled deploy.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "orange"
          },
          "unit": null,
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total{namespace=\"$namespace\", container=\"payments-api\"}) or vector(0)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Replicas unavailable",
      "description": "Desired minus available.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "red"
          },
          "unit": null,
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max(kube_deployment_status_replicas_unavailable{deployment=\"payments-api\", namespace=\"$namespace\"}) or vector(0)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Is it succeeding?",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Requests by status",
      "description": "Real requests only. Misses a request that returns success carrying wrong data.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "unit": "reqps",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 18,
            "gradientMode": "opacity",
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal",
              "group": "A"
            },
            "axisSoftMin": 0,
            "scaleDistribution": {
              "type": "linear"
            }
          },
          "noValue": "no requests (probes excluded)"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "2.."
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "green"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "5.."
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "4.."
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "orange"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (status) (rate(payments_api_requests_total{namespace=\"$namespace\", path!~\"/healthz|/readyz\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{status}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Share of requests failing",
      "description": "Reads zero when nothing is being served at all. Read it beside Targets up.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 10
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 18,
            "gradientMode": "opacity",
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            },
            "axisSoftMin": 0,
            "scaleDistribution": {
              "type": "linear"
            }
          },
          "noValue": "0"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(sum(rate(payments_api_requests_total{namespace=\"$namespace\", path!~\"/healthz|/readyz\", status!~\"2..\"}[5m])) or vector(0)) / clamp_min((sum(rate(payments_api_requests_total{namespace=\"$namespace\", path!~\"/healthz|/readyz\"}[5m])) or vector(0)), 0.0001)",
          "legendFormat": "failing share",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Request duration",
      "description": "Misses the request that never completes: it never becomes an observation, so this can improve as the service becomes unusable.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "unit": "s",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 18,
            "gradientMode": "opacity",
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            },
            "axisSoftMin": 0,
            "scaleDistribution": {
              "type": "linear"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "p95"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "orange"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "p50"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "blue"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(payments_api_request_duration_seconds_bucket{namespace=\"$namespace\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(payments_api_request_duration_seconds_bucket{namespace=\"$namespace\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Rollout",
      "description": "A readiness failure does not take the service down -- the previous version keeps serving -- so nothing else moves much. This is where a wedged deploy becomes visible.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 18
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "unit": null,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 18,
            "gradientMode": "opacity",
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            },
            "axisSoftMin": 0,
            "scaleDistribution": {
              "type": "linear"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "desired"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "blue"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "updated"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "purple"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "available"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "green"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max(kube_deployment_spec_replicas{deployment=\"payments-api\", namespace=\"$namespace\"}) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "desired",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max(kube_deployment_status_replicas_updated{deployment=\"payments-api\", namespace=\"$namespace\"}) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "updated",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max(kube_deployment_status_replicas_available{deployment=\"payments-api\", namespace=\"$namespace\"}) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "available",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
